{"name":"Enchanted Isle","hex":"#8ec5c0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"enchanted","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of enchant"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Charmed, delighted, enraptured.","Under the influence of enchantment."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/enchanted"},{"term":"isle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An island, usually very small. Compare with islet."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Obsolete spelling of aisle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/isle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tahiti Drink","blocks":[{"text":"Tahiti Drink is an alcoholic mixed-drink cocktail that has been made by Manutea Tahiti S.A.\n since 1984. It is manufactured on the island of Moorea and is sold in distinctively colored cartons. The drink, used as both a cocktail and a mixer, is a combination of pineapple, passion fruit and orange juices, to which vanilla and cane spirit are added."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/05/Tahiti_Drink.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tahiti_Drink"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"enchanted":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/En-us-enchanted.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/En-us-enchanted.ogg/En-us-enchanted.ogg.mp3"}],"isle":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/En-us-isle.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c8/En-us-isle.ogg/En-us-isle.ogg.mp3"}]}}}